       interfaces and errors. No I/O, clock or random ids (BannedSymbols.txt, spec §4b.1). aw-meta CLI for the /meta skill: the meta orchestrator's obligations (inbox/outbox), lane map, gate and merge runner, owner queue, health and running log; state under $AW_STATE_DIR/meta; a thin harness Sindri absorbs later -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <RootNamespace>Aw.Meta.Core</RootNamespace>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions" />
    <PackageReference Include="Vogen" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="../../Aw.Kernel/Aw.Kernel.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Aw.Meta.Tests" />
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Aw.Meta.Testing" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
